//api.github.com/users/blakerouse/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blakerouse/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--Ex. Fixing a bug - Describe the bug and how this fixes the issue.\r\nEx. Adding a feature - Explain what this achieves.-->\r\n#### Description\r\n\r\nThe requests that failed while the collector was shutting down were deleted from the persistent queue instead of being redelivered after a restart. Only the retry sender reported such failures as shutdown errors, and only when a backoff wait was interrupted, so exporters that don't enable `retry_on_failure` always lost the requests that were in flight when the destination was unavailable. Requests that fail with a permanent error are still dropped.\r\n\r\n<!-- Issue number if applicable -->\r\n#### Link to tracking issue\r\nFixes #15677 \r\n\r\n<!--Describe what testing was performed and which tests were added.-->\r\n#### Testing\r\n\r\nCovered by added unit tests and I tested it with the elasticsearchexporter and confirms it resolves the issue in a persistent queue integration test.\r\n\r\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must not check this box on behalf\r\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is ready for review.-->\r\n#### Authorship\r\n\r\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\r\n","labels":[{"id":2342386322,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzQyMzg2MzIy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/labels/Stale","name":"Stale","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-29T00:35:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T03:32:02Z","closed_at":"2026-10-26T03:32:02Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"54b4b0ed48e51b3bfc890ffc39bcf2517d27af57","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"bog